    "section_xMUjUD": {
      "type": "section",
      "blocks": {
        "text_VRAzXd": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A warranty is only as good as the peace of mind it provides. We have taken this to heart, and are proud to present a Three-Year Megabass® Rod Warranty.</p><p>This warranty is limited to retail sales of Megabass® rods in the United States of America, Canada, and Mexico, by Megabass of America and its authorized dealers. This warranty applies to the original owner only, and is non-transferrable.</p><p>If you have any questions or concerns, please do not hesitate to contact us; we’re glad to help!</p>",
            "width": "100%",
            "max_width": "none",
            "alignment": "left",
            "type_preset": "rte",
            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "font_size": "",
            "paragraph_size": "paragraph-md",
            "line_height": "normal",
            "letter_spacing": "normal",
            "case": "none",
            "wrap": "pretty",
            "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
            "custom_color": "#000000",
            "background": false,
            "background_color": "#00000026",
            "corner_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0,
            "hidden_mobile": false
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "accordion_ztcWPB": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "name": "t:names.accordion",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "caret",
            "dividers": true,
            "type_preset": "h5",
            "inherit_color_scheme": true,
            "color_scheme": "",
            "border": "none",
            "border_width": 1,
            "border_opacity": 100,
            "border_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {
            "accordion_row_QCQMpa": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "- 1 Year Free Repair or Replacement Policy",
                "open_by_default": true,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_Dhgn3P": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Megabass of America will repair or replace your Megabass® rod free of charge for a period of one (1) year from date of initial purchase. Limited to one free replacement/repair per rod.</p><p>If damage to your rod cannot be repaired, a no-fee replacement will be sent to you as soon as possible. Exchanges and upgrades are not permitted. Megabass of America reserves the right to replace a model that is no longer in production with a current model of our choosing.</p><p>After the first year (or after the first claim, whichever comes first), repairs will be charged at a discounted rate.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "paragraph_size": "paragraph-md",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "custom_color": "#000000",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0,
                    "hidden_mobile": false
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_Dhgn3P"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_hTUmfq": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "- Claims After 1 Year",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_4QtqFE": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>After the first year (or after the first claim, whichever comes first), repairs will be charged at a discounted rate.</p><p>No-questions-asked replacements will be charged a flat-fee equal to 60% off of listed MSRP (for example, a $299 rod would be $119.60 to replace).</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "paragraph_size": "paragraph-md",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "custom_color": "#000000",
